{
	"_about": "cypress: a 62.5s launch film for an AI teammate that joins a video call and builds things while the team talks, derived frame-by-frame from a 62.5s feature launch film (1920x1080 @24fps). Authored on the 1280x720 stage, rendered at device scale 1.5: render.mjs --fps 24 --scale 1.5. Placeholder product: Cypress, an AI teammate added to a call; placeholder team: Little Ember Coffee picking its winter special. It cuts between two worlds on hard frames: a near-black CALL world (tile grid, the agent's coral blob tile with a hand-drawn line and a status) and a warm CREAM world (serif claims, voice-transcript and reply bubbles, a gridded whiteboard with sticky notes and multiplayer name-tag cursors, a chat feed, a meeting-notes doc with a Gantt plan, a word-swap tagline and a mark + wordmark end card).",
	"_sections": "S1 0-14.8 call grid fills and reflows, the agent tile joins; close-up 'Hey team' sunrise; cream title with a voice request transcribed word by word and the agent's reply | S2 14.8-29.5 full-frame agent tile 'Taking notes... / Starting whiteboard', pixel iris into the whiteboard: claim, docked call window, sticker, heading typed, 17 notes typed by named cursors; cream claim 2 + second voice request | S3 29.5-47.4 'Organizing ideas' tile; notes dragged into three column panels, votes stamped; whip up to the chat feed: thread, request, 'On it.' | S4 47.4-62.5 meeting-notes doc grows a Gantt launch plan card; whip to the word-swap tagline; mark blooms and the wordmark types",
	"_slots": "Image slots: people[].photo / avatarSrc (call-grid, agent-hello: webcam tiles and cam-off avatars; drawn stand-ins without them), participants[].src (s2-whiteboard docked window), stickerSrc (s2-whiteboard, s3-board: the team's sticker), markSrc (reply-1, s3-chat, endcard: your mark; a drawn six-petal bloom stands in). Every piece of copy is a scene field.",
